  "value": "Service i starts at throughput[i]; after x_i upgrades (each costing scalingCost[i]) its throughput is throughput[i]*(1+x_i). Choose non-negative upgrade counts with total cost sum(x_i*scalingCost[i]) <= budget to maximise the pipeline throughput, the minimum over services. Return that maximum.",
